sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant NC as NotificationCenter
    participant Hook as useNotifications
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant SM as SubscriptionManager
    participant Relay as NOSTR Relay
    participant IDB as IndexedDB
    participant Desktop as Desktop API

    User->>NC: Opens app
    NC->>Hook: Initialize
    Hook->>NS: subscribeToNotifications(pubkey)
    NS->>IDB: Load cached notifications
    IDB-->>NS: Return notifications
    NS-->>Hook: Initial notifications
    Hook-->>NC: Display notifications

    NS->>SM: Subscribe to filters
    Note over NS,SM: Filters: mentions, replies,<br/>reactions, DMs, follows
    SM->>Relay: Subscribe to events

    Relay-->>SM: New event (mention)
    SM-->>NS: Process event
    NS->>NS: Create notification
    NS->>IDB: Store notification
    NS->>Desktop: Show desktop notification
    NS-->>Hook: Update notifications
    Hook-->>NC: Re-render with new notification
    NC->>User: Display toast + sound

    User->>NC: Click notification
    NC->>NS: markAsRead(id)
    NS->>IDB: Update read status
    NS-->>Hook: Update state
    Hook-->>NC: Update UI

    User->>NC: Click "Mark all read"
    NC->>NS: markAllAsRead()
    NS->>IDB: Bulk update
    NS-->>Hook: Clear unread count
    Hook-->>NC: Update badge
